I look at the hot tea.
I drink the tea.
It is very sweet and strong.
A plate is on the table.
There is a 'bun maska' in the plate.
There is a lot of butter inside the bun.
I break off a piece of the bun.
I dip that piece into the tea.
I eat that delicious bun.
Its taste is excellent.
There is an open door near me.
I look outside through the door.
Outside, the street is very busy.
Many people are walking here.
I watch all of that.
This experience of Mumbai is excellent.
I am very happy here.
I enjoy the tea and the food.
